      <title>JUST IN: Jensen Huang releases statement after being reinstated as Nvidia $NVDA </title>
      <link>https://t.me/WatcherGuru/16277</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;b&gt;JUST IN: &lt;/b&gt;Jensen Huang releases statement after being reinstated as Nvidia $NVDA CEO. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;"I am honoured to return to Nvidia and lead one of the most consequential technology companies in the world at the beginning of a new industrial revolution.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I take this responsibility with the greatest humility and renewed commitment.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I want to thank the Nvidia board for its confidence and deliberation through this process. I am especially grateful to Harvey Jones for his leadership as chair, and to Colette Kress and our executive staff for leading Nvidia during this period.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;I am also deeply thankful to our employees, shareholders, leaders across the industry and partners around the world for their extraordinary support. Above all, I am grateful for the love and support of my family. I can't wait to get back to work."&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B0.png')"&gt;&lt;b&gt;📰&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://watcherguru.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://watcherguru.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/WatcherGuru" target="_blank"&gt;@WatcherGuru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
